  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh RRNRP: Contribution to CARE to support the Need Assessment Working Group (NAWG) for disaster and relief coordination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Need Assessment Working Group (NAWG) for disaster and relief coordination in Bangladesh. The project is bilateral ODA implemented by CARE International. This is ODA eligible as the programme will be supporting Government of Bangladesh in disaster preparedness. Bangladesh is within the DAC List of ODA recipient countries.</narrative>
  </description>
